{"scene_id": "pt_ghosts_33", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_ghosts_33.fountain", "heading": "INT. GHOSTS - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "OSWALD", "names": ["OSWALD"], "gender": "?", "first": 1, "spoke": 18}, {"id": 1, "name": "ALVING", "names": ["ALVING", "MRS. ALVING"], "gender": "?", "first": 2, "spoke": 14}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. GHOSTS - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No, never that! That is just what I will not have. I can't endure to think that perhaps I should lie in that state for many years--and get old and grey. And in the meantime you might die and leave me.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0]}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Sits in MRS. ALVING'S chair.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 3, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "For the doctor said it wouldn't necessarily prove fatal at once. He called it a sort of softening of the brain--or something like that.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Smiles sadly.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I think that expression sounds so nice. It always sets me thinking of cherry-coloured velvet--something soft and delicate to stroke.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Shrieks.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Oswald!", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Springs up and paces the room.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And now you have taken Regina from me. If I could only have had her! She would have come to the rescue, I know.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Goes to him.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What do you mean by that, my darling boy? Is there any help in the world that I would not give you?", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "When I got over my attack in Paris, the doctor told me that when it comes again--and it will come--there will be no more hope.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He was heartless enough to--", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I demanded it of him. I told him I had preparations to make--", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "He smiles cunningly.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And so I had.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "He takes a little box from his inner breast pocket and opens it.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mother, do you see this?", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What is it?", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Morphia.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Looks at him horror-struck.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Oswald--my boy!", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I've scraped together twelve pilules--", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Snatches at it.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Give me the box, Oswald.", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not yet, mother.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "He hides the box again in his pocket.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I shall never survive this!", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It must be survived. Now if I'd had Regina here, I should have told her how things stood with me--and begged her to come to the rescue at the last. She would have done it. I know she would.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Never!", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "When the horror had come upon me, and she saw me lying there helpless, like a little new-born baby, impotent, lost, hopeless--past all saving--", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Never in all the world would Regina have done this!", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Regina would have done it. Regina was so splendidly light-hearted. And she would soon have wearied of nursing an invalid like me.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then heaven be praised that Regina is not here.", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Well then, it is you that must come to the rescue, mother.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Shrieks aloud.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I!", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Who should do it if not you?", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I! your mother!", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "For that very reason.", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I, who gave you life!", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I never asked you for life. And what sort of a life have you given me? I will not have it! You shall take it back again!", "name": "OSWALD", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Help! Help!", "name": "MRS. ALVING", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "She runs out into the hall.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Going after her.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}]}